@HostAddress = http://localhost:5165

### 200 - PREPAID / CLOSED -> ACTION3, ACTION4, ACTION9
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=Card17

### 200 - DEBIT / BLOCKED z PIN-em -> ACTION3, ACTION4, ACTION6, ACTION7, ACTION8, ACTION9
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=Card112

### 200 - CREDIT / ACTIVE bez PIN-u -> zawiera ACTION5 (tylko karty kredytowe)
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=Card117

### 400 - brak obu parametrów
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card

### 400 - lista wartości zamiast identyfikatora
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=1,2,4&cardNumber=Card17

### 400 - wartość ujemna w numerze karty
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=-1

### 404 - nieznana karta
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=Card999

### 404 - karta innego użytkownika (Card21 należy do User2)
GET {{HostAddress}}/Card?userId=User1&cardNumber=Card21
